                                "sense_id": "0f6396d7-292e-39ee-a46d-f7cf8ffd5306",
                                "text": "«Your husband told me to bring this to you, Mrs. Baroda,» he said, handing her a filmy, white scarf with which she sometimes enveloped her head and shoulders."
                            },
