                                "sense_id": "0f6396d7-292e-39ee-a46d-f7cf8ffd5306",
                                "text": "In the ball-room the young ladies of Percy's party would appear — Jessie, his sweetheart, among them — gowned in filmy chiffons and laces, floating in a mist of perfume and colour and music."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
